    "edmBranch": "FillGeneratorClass.js _addSmallFill/_addMediumFill/_addBigFill EDM block (switch 0-4) — identical across all three sizes (:31-67,:140-176,:231-267)",
    "smallFill_default": "FillGeneratorClass.js#_addSmallFill non-EDM (focusOnSnareDrum x3 / focusOnKickDrum — :69-130)",
    "mediumFill_default": "FillGeneratorClass.js#_addMediumFill non-EDM (tom cases 0-4 + flam — :178-225)",
    "bigFill_default": "FillGeneratorClass.js#_addBigFill non-EDM (expandMiddleFill x2 / standaloneFill — :269-409). NB: the legacy standaloneFill switch is selectRandomly([0,1]); cases 2-7 (:355-403) are unreachable dead code and are intentionally NOT ported (parity = match legacy live behaviour)."
  },
